    m: size,
    n: size,
    alpha: DATA_TYPE,
    beta: DATA_TYPE,
    C: DATA_TYPE[m, n] @ DRAM,
    A: DATA_TYPE[m, m] @ DRAM,
    B: DATA_TYPE[m, n] @ DRAM,
):
    """
    Reference implementation of the symmetric matrix-matrix multiply:

        C := beta * C + alpha * A * B

    where A is stored as a lower-triangular part of a symmetric matrix.
    This is a direct transcription of the original PolyBench kernel.
    """
