#
# We improve data locality by tiling the (i, j) iteration space.  We:
#   1. Tile the i-loop (rows) and j-loop (columns).
#   2. Reorder the resulting tile loops to traverse blocks of columns
#      within a block of rows, which improves cache reuse of A and B.
#   3. Run a simplification pass and finally rename the scheduled
#      procedure to 'kernel_symm', which is the entry point used by C.
